Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:52:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/17] ttf: read a component's 2x2 transform in OpenType order

A glyf component transform maps x' = xx * x + xy * y, y' = yx * x + yy * y;
kurbo::Affine takes [xx, yx, xy, yy, dx, dy]. The reader passed xy and yx
the other way round, which turned rotated or skewed components the wrong way
(mirroring and scaling were unaffected).

resources/ttf/StaticLegacy.ttf is a small static font made by
resources/ttf/make_fixtures.py; barrot turns bar 90 degrees.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
